Why you! Come back here!

00:02:08.320 --> 00:02:09.020
Kei, calm down!

00:02:11.460 --> 00:02:13.120
Think you can escape, huh?

00:02:17.130 --> 00:02:17.930
Take this!

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:23.440
See what a good shot I am?

00:02:23.440 --> 00:02:23.810
Yeah, fantastic...
See what a good shot I am?

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:24.670
Yeah, fantastic...

00:02:25.110 --> 00:02:26.270
Damn you.

00:02:26.710 --> 00:02:27.680
Let's finish this!

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:28.970
You're not done yet?

00:02:33.450 --> 00:02:34.650
Mission complete!

00:02:34.650 --> 00:02:36.170
I sure hope so.

00:02:37.890 --> 00:02:39.580
Ow ow ow...

00:02:40.090 --> 00:02:41.760
It's the end of the line, BJ.

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:42.760
Just give up.

00:02:42.760 --> 00:02:44.960
B-B-BJ?

00:02:44.960 --> 00:02:47.660
What are you talking about? I'm not BJ!

00:02:47.660 --> 00:02:48.650
Huh?
Huh?

00:02:56.140 --> 00:02:57.640
He doesn't look like the guy in the picture.

00:02:57.640 --> 00:02:57.970
You're right.
He doesn't look like the guy in the picture.

00:02:57.970 --> 00:02:58.570
You're right.

00:02:58.570 --> 00:03:00.840
So, what are you going to do me?

00:03:00.840 --> 00:03:02.880
We're not going to do anything to you.

00:03:02.880 --> 00:03:05.240
Why'd you shoot at us like that, then?

00:03:05.380 --> 00:03:09.180
I thought you were burglars!
You know how dangerous it is around here.

00:03:09.180 --> 00:03:10.750
Why were you in that room?

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:12.920
It was the only room available.

00:03:12.920 --> 00:03:15.620
BJ is supposed to be staying in that room.

00:03:15.620 --> 00:03:17.430
But I'm not BJ!

00:03:17.430 --> 00:03:19.060
Room 503, right?

00:03:19.060 --> 00:03:19.530
Yeah.
Room 503, right?

00:03:19.530 --> 00:03:19.900
Yeah.
Hotel Dada?

00:03:19.900 --> 00:03:20.530
Hotel Dada?

00:03:20.530 --> 00:03:20.800
Dada is next door. See?
Hotel Dada?

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:21.860
Dada is next door. See?

00:03:21.860 --> 00:03:22.800
Huh?
Huh?

00:03:26.030 --> 00:03:28.760
