those signs less confusing?

00:03:35.280 --> 00:03:41.240
Pardon Us
Trouble's On the Run,
So We're Coming Through!

00:03:44.690 --> 00:03:46.960
Yuri, you guard the back door.

00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:51.150
Be quick, okay? I never wait
for anyone, not even my dates.

00:03:51.560 --> 00:03:53.190
It'll be over in no time.

00:03:57.900 --> 00:04:00.630
This time for sure. 501...

00:04:01.100 --> 00:04:03.070
502...

00:04:18.220 --> 00:04:20.050
Welcome back. That was quick.

00:04:20.720 --> 00:04:23.590
Serves you right!
That's the emergency exit.

00:04:24.560 --> 00:04:26.620
Huh? Where'd she go?

00:04:27.900 --> 00:04:31.860
Sorry to disappoint you,
but I refuse to die at such a young age!

00:04:32.700 --> 00:04:35.670
Ow! Ow! Ow!

00:04:35.670 --> 00:04:37.230
Lemme down!

00:04:46.920 --> 00:04:49.110
You almost split me in two.

00:04:50.090 --> 00:04:52.350
A perfect match! So you're BJ, right?

00:04:52.350 --> 00:04:55.620
Nope. I just changed my name to "Screw Up."

00:04:55.620 --> 00:04:57.390
Okay, I'll call you that instead.

00:04:57.390 --> 00:05:00.420
Whatever. Could you do
something about this rope?

00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:07.330
This, huh? Figures.

00:05:08.670 --> 00:05:12.310
Oh, you're way more of a hunk
in person than in your photo.

00:05:12.310 --> 00:05:14.380
There she goes again.

00:05:14.380 --> 00:05:16.240
I was just pretending to be you.

00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:19.350
Idiot.

00:05:21.850 --> 00:05:24.050
His new name suits him much better.

00:05:26.290 --> 00:05:29.750
Got it? You really should
behave, Mr. Screw Up.

00:05:33.090 --> 00:05:35.200
Kei, I think you overdid it again.

00:05:35.200 --> 00:05:37.830
He doesn't look that wimpy, though.

00:05:46.410 --> 00:05:48.680
Looks like it's your turn to behave.

00:05:48.680 --> 00:05:50.610
Now get this thing off of me.

00:05:50.610 --> 00:05:54.780
If you don't, I'll put a hole in her stomach
and spray her guts all over the ground.

00:05:54.780 --> 00:05:55.850
Go ahead and try.

00:05:55.850 --> 00:05:56.780
What?

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:02.890
Dammit, it's empty!

00:06:03.430 --> 00:06:05.930
I used up all the shots earlier.

00:06:05.930 --> 00:06:07.990
You see, she's really trigger-happy.

00:06:09.530 --> 00:06:12.630
H-Hey, wait. I won't try to escape anymore.

00:06:12.630 --> 00:06:13.790
I'm begging you!

00:06:20.310 --> 00:06:23.280
I've been told they captured BJ.

00:06:23.280 --> 00:06:24.580
That's good to hear.

00:06:24.580 --> 00:06:28.350
He fled outside our jurisdiction,
so we weren't able to pursue him.

00:06:28.350 --> 00:06:30.850
So you'll come and get him
immediately, I assume?

00:06:30.850 --> 00:06:34.860
The thing is, we're a bit shorthanded right now.

00:06:34.860 --> 00:06:37.790
If possible, I'd like them to bring him in instead.

00:06:37.790 --> 00:06:40.450
Of course, we'll pay for the additional service.

00:06:42.900 --> 00:06:46.700
What? You want us to
deliver him to the Slum Police?

00:06:46.700 --> 00:06:49.270
They just requested it.

00:06:49.270 --> 00:06:52.070
The police should come and get him.

00:06:52.070 --> 00:06:53.880
We're not delivery girls.

00:06:53.880 --> 00:06:54.910
She's right.

00:06:54.910 --> 00:06:59.380
All we were asked to do was to catch BJ.

00:06:59.380 --> 00:07:04.180
I see. So was obliterating a building
just an extra bit of service?

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:05.550
Th-That was, well...

00:07:05.550 --> 00:07:05.850
You idiots!
Th-That was, well...

00:07:05.850 --> 00:07:07.050
You idiots!

00:07:08.090 --> 00:07:12.130
You destroyed an entire building
just to catch a petty thief!

00:07:12.130 --> 00:07:14.560
Normally, you'd lose your license for that.

00:07:14.560 --> 00:07:16.530
If you see what I'm getting at,
then follow my orders!

00:07:16.530 --> 00:07:17.670
Yes, yes...

00:07:17.670 --> 00:07:18.800
One "yes" is good enough!

00:07:18.800 --> 00:07:19.030
Yes!
One "yes" is good enough!

00:07:19.030 --> 00:07:19.940
Yes!

00:07:19.940 --> 00:07:24.700
Good. Now turn on your homing signal
so we can track your location.

00:07:28.740 --> 00:07:30.730
They're on the move.

00:07:33.820 --> 00:07:35.880
Kei, we're almost out of fuel.

00:07:35.880 --> 00:07:39.220
Let's refuel, then.
We can expense it, anyway.

00:07:44.530 --> 00:07:49.160
Hey, I could use some
refueling too, you know.

00:07:49.160 --> 00:07:50.570
Stop being so needy.

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:53.500
Yeah. No need to feed your catch
if it's already been caught.

00:07:53.500 --> 00:07:57.300
Jeez! You two are terrible.
I bet you're gonna die a horrible death.

00:07:59.910 --> 00:08:01.310
Thank you!

00:08:01.310 --> 00:08:02.440
Come again.

00:08:06.380 --> 00:08:07.080
Huh?

00:08:07.650 --> 00:08:09.670
The warning light is flashing.

00:08:10.290 --> 00:08:12.950
But all we did was refuel.

00:08:13.120 --> 00:08:15.280
We're two kilos over the maximum weight.

00:08:16.220 --> 00:08:18.030
Let me off, and you'll be fine.

00:08:18.030 --> 00:08:19.690
Even if we let you off, you can't escape.

00:08:21.030 --> 00:08:24.130
Honestly, I bet you've gained weight again.

00:08:24.130 --> 00:08:28.090
Hmph. If you take off all that makeup,
we'll be at least two kilos lighter.

00:08:29.040 --> 00:08:31.440
Huh? I hear a strange noise.

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:46.210
It-It looks like a time bomb!

00:08:47.820 --> 00:08:50.530
Like I said, you'll die a horrible death!

00:08:50.530 --> 00:08:51.390
...Huh?!

00:08:52.360 --> 00:08:52.920
Ow!

00:08:55.260 --> 00:08:57.290
Hey, do something, quick!

00:09:15.680 --> 00:09:17.820
Phew, that was close.

00:09:17.820 --> 00:09:18.190
Get your hands off of me already!
Phew, that was close.

00:09:18.190 --> 00:09:19.990
Get your hands off of me already!

00:09:19.990 --> 00:09:22.010
Come on, don't be so uptight.

00:09:22.090 --> 00:09:24.250
Guys like you are the worst!

00:09:29.830 --> 00:09:30.990
Sorry...

00:09:35.940 --> 00:09:39.070
I-I did it for your sake! For your sake, okay?

00:09:39.340 --> 00:09:41.540
Yuri! Wake up, Yuri!

00:09:41.940 --> 00:09:44.050
I see. A bomb, huh?

00:09:44.050 --> 00:09:45.950
Just as I suspected.

00:09:45.950 --> 00:09:48.540
As you suspected? Do you have a lead?

00:09:49.220 --> 00:09:54.320
Truth is, Gooley, a gang is after BJ.

00:09:54.320 --> 00:09:56.880
A gang? What do you mean?

00:09:57.030 --> 00:10:00.830
They'll use any means necessary to kill BJ.

00:10:00.830 --> 00:10:04.090
I really hope those two can bring him in safely.

00:10:04.930 --> 00:10:08.000
I swear, I didn't do it on purpose!

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:10.130
Could you just drop it already?

00:10:10.570 --> 00:10:11.640
Yeah, you're right.

00:10:11.640 --> 00:10:11.870
Huh?
Yeah, you're right.

00:10:11.870 --> 00:10:12.210
Huh?

00:10:12.210 --> 00:10:12.740
Huh?
Anyway, what now? We don't have a car anymore.

00:10:12.740 --> 00:10:16.140
Anyway, what now? We don't have a car anymore.

00:10:16.140 --> 00:10:17.810
This place is dangerous.

00:10:17.980 --> 00:10:20.750
We'd better get out of here quick
or we'll be stripped naked.

00:10:20.750 --> 00:10:22.620
Shall we hitchhike?

00:10:22.620 --> 00:10:26.610
Do you see a car or anyone passing by?
Because I sure don't.

00:10:27.590 --> 00:10:31.460
Looks like you two will have to
take turns carrying me on your back.

00:10:31.460 --> 00:10:33.760
I'm too hungry to walk anymore.

00:10:33.760 --> 00:10:36.230
How about I make you walk?

00:10:36.230 --> 00:10:39.100
D-Don't! Three times is enough!

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:50.480
You gettin' on, or what?
If you don't wanna ride, we're leaving.

00:10:50.610 --> 00:10:51.810
We're getting on!

00:10:52.710 --> 00:10:54.180
I didn't realize this was a bus stop.

00:10:59.820 --> 00:11:01.190
We're saved.

00:11:01.190 --> 00:11:03.690
By the way, I wonder
where this bus is headed?

00:11:03.690 --> 00:11:06.030
I don't know, but this
seems like the right direction.

00:11:06.030 --> 00:11:09.100
Eh, doesn't matter. It beats walking.

00:11:09.100 --> 00:11:12.100
It sure does! Right, lovely ladies?

00:11:12.100 --> 00:11:15.200
Why don't you forget about your
lame old job and run away with me?

00:11:15.200 --> 00:11:19.730
You can have anything you want.
Pretty outfits, lots of good food...

00:11:22.610 --> 00:11:24.440
It was a joke, a joke!

00:11:57.080 --> 00:12:01.080
Looks like we'll get there without a hitch.
This job ended up being kinda' easy, didn't it?

00:12:01.080 --> 00:12:02.850
Don't you think you're being too optimistic?

00:12:02.850 --> 00:12:05.390
You must be a pretty bad guy, huh?

00:12:05.390 --> 00:12:08.790
No way. I've never done anything
that'd make someone want to kill me.

00:12:08.790 --> 00:12:11.850
Well, whatever you did, it doesn't
make a difference to us, anyway.

00:12:15.900 --> 00:12:16.860
What's the matter?

00:12:20.100 --> 00:12:21.400
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:12:21.400 --> 00:12:22.000
Huh?
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:12:23.340 --> 00:12:25.500
Huh? What's that?

00:12:26.070 --> 00:12:27.670
They're blockin' the road.

00:12:30.040 --> 00:12:31.780
Don't stop. Keep going.

00:12:31.780 --> 00:12:33.350
Eh? Who are you?

00:12:33.350 --> 00:12:34.150
Just go!

00:12:34.150 --> 00:12:34.710
Ow!

00:12:48.200 --> 00:12:49.830
What's with you two?!

00:12:49.830 --> 00:12:52.330
Don't involve us in your troubles!

00:12:52.330 --> 00:12:54.040
You're already involved.

00:12:54.040 --> 00:12:54.340
Sorry.
You're already involved.

00:12:54.340 --> 00:12:55.320
Sorry.

00:12:58.240 --> 00:12:59.040
See?

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:00.370
Too bad for them.

00:13:00.440 --> 00:13:01.910
What am I supposed to do?

00:13:02.210 --> 00:13:05.180
We're in the middle of transporting that guy
to the police station, under official orders.

00:13:05.180 --> 00:13:06.850
Those guys outside are criminals!

00:13:06.850 --> 00:13:07.750
No kidding!

00:13:11.120 --> 00:13:12.420
Take this!

00:13:19.130 --> 00:13:20.220
Why you!

00:13:21.330 --> 00:13:23.460
All right, let's get 'em!

00:13:27.270 --> 00:13:28.100
These eggs...

00:13:28.100 --> 00:13:28.900
...were expensive...

00:13:28.900 --> 00:13:29.730
...you know!

00:13:31.340 --> 00:13:32.900
Damn it, I can't see!

00:13:34.010 --> 00:13:35.600
I'll make you into pancakes!

00:13:37.950 --> 00:13:39.110
Yeah!

00:13:53.160 --> 00:13:54.630
I can't take it!

00:14:13.450 --> 00:14:14.880
It stinks!

00:14:14.880 --> 00:14:16.920
Why do we have to be down here?

00:14:16.920 --> 00:14:18.790
It's better than dying, right?

00:14:18.790 --> 00:14:21.550
Honestly, it seems like we're
always in the sewer lately!

00:14:29.230 --> 00:14:31.200
No! This stuff's going to stain my outfit!

00:14:31.200 --> 00:14:31.470
Forget about that, just shoot!
No! This stuff's going to stain my outfit!

00:14:31.470 --> 00:14:32.730
Forget about that, just shoot!

00:14:34.770 --> 00:14:37.340
How did they know we were
heading in this direction?

00:14:37.340 --> 00:14:38.530
Beats me.

00:14:49.450 --> 00:14:50.250
What the heck?

00:14:50.250 --> 00:14:50.690
You've gotta to be kidding me.
What the heck?

00:14:50.690 --> 00:14:51.580
You've gotta to be kidding me.

00:14:59.590 --> 00:15:00.560
Yuri, watch out!

00:15:08.200 --> 00:15:09.360
What is that thing?

00:15:09.640 --> 00:15:10.930
It's a cleaning ball.

00:15:11.310 --> 00:15:13.430
It's a machine that cleans out the sewers.

00:15:13.640 --> 00:15:15.040
Are you all right, Yuri?

00:15:16.080 --> 00:15:17.640
I hate this!

00:15:20.580 --> 00:15:21.570
Well?

00:15:23.280 --> 00:15:24.580
Looks safe.

00:15:28.490 --> 00:15:29.060
What?

00:15:29.060 --> 00:15:30.020
It's them.

00:15:35.800 --> 00:15:37.000
What do you want to do?

00:15:37.000 --> 00:15:37.990
Follow me.

00:15:47.310 --> 00:15:48.570
Damn it!

00:15:53.610 --> 00:15:56.210
They can't do anything to us
as long as we're in here.

00:15:56.620 --> 00:15:58.890
3WA Headquarters.
Chief, can you hear me?

00:15:58.890 --> 00:16:00.350
Where have you been?

00:16:00.350 --> 00:16:02.590
Why haven't you reported in until now?

00:16:02.590 --> 00:16:04.690
We're in a restaurant
in Slum City right now.

00:16:04.690 --> 00:16:05.860
A restaurant?

00:16:05.860 --> 00:16:08.800
Oh, taking a tea break, are we? How nice.

00:16:08.800 --> 00:16:12.460
Stop being sarcastic!
We've already been attacked twice.

00:16:12.770 --> 00:16:15.400
They have the restaurant
surrounded even as we speak.

00:16:16.140 --> 00:16:18.310
They must be syndicate members.

00:16:18.310 --> 00:16:19.270
Syndicate?

00:16:19.270 --> 00:16:23.340
You see, BJ is an important
witness for an upcoming hearing.

00:16:23.340 --> 00:16:26.180
He's the key to taking down the
biggest drug syndicate on the planet.

00:16:26.180 --> 00:16:28.910
Oh? You're quite an important guy.

00:16:29.620 --> 00:16:31.380
But it still doesn't make sense.

00:16:31.920 --> 00:16:34.990
They're always waiting for us wherever we go.

00:16:34.990 --> 00:16:39.120
The only one who knows our position
is the Slum City police chief, right?

00:16:39.590 --> 00:16:41.630
Okay, I'll go visit the Slum City police.

00:16:41.630 --> 00:16:43.120
You two do your best.

00:16:43.430 --> 00:16:45.160
"Do our best," he says...

00:16:45.230 --> 00:16:46.000
Your order?

00:16:46.000 --> 00:16:46.370
What should we do?
Your order?

00:16:46.370 --> 00:16:47.660
What should we do?

00:16:47.800 --> 00:16:49.100
I see something good.

00:16:51.370 --> 00:16:53.210
That truck would be as good as a tank.

00:16:53.210 --> 00:16:53.440
Your order?
That truck would be as good as a tank.

00:16:53.440 --> 00:16:54.510
Your order?

00:16:54.510 --> 00:16:56.310
Wouldn't that just cause more trouble?

00:16:56.310 --> 00:16:58.750
This coming from the woman
who already destroyed a hotel?

00:16:58.750 --> 00:17:00.050
Point taken.

00:17:00.050 --> 00:17:01.310
Your order?

00:17:01.520 --> 00:17:03.250
One tractor trailer, please!
One tractor trailer, please!

00:17:05.950 --> 00:17:06.650
Stop!

00:17:15.860 --> 00:17:17.690
Hey, he's a police officer.

00:17:17.870 --> 00:17:18.700
What?

00:17:18.700 --> 00:17:19.930
This guy is, too.

00:17:20.100 --> 00:17:23.830
Even I'm surprised. Who would've
thought the police would be after us?

00:17:27.610 --> 00:17:29.470
So what you're saying is...

00:17:30.010 --> 00:17:32.140
...there's an information leak?

00:17:32.280 --> 00:17:34.180
That's the only possible explanation.

00:17:34.180 --> 00:17:37.720
Chief, are you sure there
isn't more to your story?

00:17:37.720 --> 00:17:39.850
I don't know what you mean.

00:17:41.760 --> 00:17:42.690
This is Gooley.

00:17:42.690 --> 00:17:44.390
Chief, what's going on?

00:17:44.390 --> 00:17:46.660
The men who attacked us are police officers!

00:17:46.860 --> 00:17:47.560
That can't be.

00:17:47.560 --> 00:17:47.760
It's true!
That can't be.

00:17:47.760 --> 00:17:48.660
It's true!

00:17:48.660 --> 00:17:51.360
There'd better be a good explanation for this.

00:17:52.900 --> 00:17:55.130
Chief, I'd like an explanation, as well.

00:17:56.300 --> 00:17:58.270
Turn off your communicator.

00:17:59.610 --> 00:18:05.250
If he testifies about the syndicate during the
hearing, it will cause trouble for a lot of people.

00:18:05.250 --> 00:18:08.410
Apparently, one of those people is in this room.

00:18:08.480 --> 00:18:09.950
Apparently.

00:18:09.950 --> 00:18:12.990
Naturally, BJ has no idea
that we're involved.

00:18:12.990 --> 00:18:17.460
So the police chief is part of a drug syndicate?
There's no decency left in this world.

00:18:17.460 --> 00:18:21.230
Come on, there are tons of
guys out there worse than me.

00:18:21.230 --> 00:18:24.070
I'm just a necessary evil.

00:18:24.070 --> 00:18:28.200
Oh well, guess you're also
nothing but a nuisance now.

00:18:39.950 --> 00:18:42.580
Chief, what happened? Chief!

00:18:42.580 --> 00:18:43.350
There it is!

00:18:49.560 --> 00:18:53.520
Listen up. If they ignore our warning,
then don't think twice. Just shoot them.

00:19:00.370 --> 00:19:02.960
Chief, we've arrived as promised.

00:19:03.140 --> 00:19:05.270
Come in, Chief!

00:19:05.270 --> 00:19:07.400
Answer us, or we'll plow
right through the guards!

00:19:08.010 --> 00:19:09.840
It's all right. Do as you like.

00:19:09.840 --> 00:19:10.440
Huh?
Huh?

00:19:11.010 --> 00:19:12.680
You were right.

00:19:12.680 --> 00:19:15.020
The man behind it all
was in the last place we'd look.

00:19:15.020 --> 00:19:16.250
Hang in there, Chief!

00:19:16.250 --> 00:19:17.990
Don't worry about me.

00:19:17.990 --> 00:19:19.550
Don't let them kill BJ, all right?

00:19:19.550 --> 00:19:19.990
Yuri!
Don't let them kill BJ, all right?

00:19:19.990 --> 00:19:20.210
Yuri!

00:19:21.690 --> 00:19:24.330
You, in the trailer! Stop the
vehicle and come out quietly!

00:19:24.330 --> 00:19:25.330
Stop, or we'll shoot!

00:19:25.330 --> 00:19:25.930
Go ahead and try it!
Stop, or we'll shoot!

00:19:25.930 --> 00:19:26.320
Go ahead and try it!

00:19:34.540 --> 00:19:35.730
Open fire!

00:20:01.960 --> 00:20:03.060
Do something to stop them!

00:20:03.060 --> 00:20:03.330
B-But!
Do something to stop them!

00:20:03.330 --> 00:20:04.300
B-But!

00:20:18.680 --> 00:20:19.580
It's him.

00:20:20.480 --> 00:20:21.850
Damn it!

00:20:22.120 --> 00:20:22.840
Why you!

00:21:04.790 --> 00:21:07.490
You sure caused us a lot of trouble.

00:21:08.100 --> 00:21:11.460
You're going to pay us a lot
for all this overtime. Got it?

00:21:20.440 --> 00:21:21.700
Chief...

00:21:22.110 --> 00:21:25.950
You didn't hold back one bit, did you?
This is a police station, you know.

00:21:25.950 --> 00:21:29.350
B-But Chief, you're the one
who said we could do anything.

00:21:29.350 --> 00:21:30.020
Right?
Right?

00:21:30.020 --> 00:21:33.590
That's true, but the situation calls
for a certain amount of restraint.

00:21:33.590 --> 00:21:36.260
But we brought BJ back safely, didn't we?

00:21:36.260 --> 00:21:39.780
All the building needs is a bit of repair.

00:21:41.600 --> 00:21:43.060
"A bit," eh?

00:21:45.130 --> 00:21:49.000
Jeez, we destroyed two
buildings for this one job.

00:21:49.000 --> 00:21:51.240
I doubt a letter of apology is gonna cut it.

00:21:51.240 --> 00:21:55.570
I know. Just imagine if we had destroyed the police
station completely! We'd be wanted criminals.

00:22:06.220 --> 00:22:07.350
W-What should we do?

00:22:07.350 --> 00:22:09.790
What do you mean, "What should
we do?" What do you think?

00:22:09.790 --> 00:22:10.930
I thought so...

00:22:10.930 --> 00:22:12.190
Run for it!
Run for it!

00:22:43.360 --> 00:22:49.860
The mystery began after I fell asleep that time
Ano toki nemuri no ato ni okotta mistuerii

00:22:49.860 --> 00:22:56.340
I was guided by a voice from the future
Mirai kara kuru koe ni michibikareta no yo

00:22:56.340 --> 00:23:02.840
I passed through a distant, silvery time tunnel
Giniro haruka na taimu tonneru nukete

00:23:02.840 --> 00:23:09.510
And met a wanderer with unclouded eyes
Deatta sunda me no samayoibito

00:23:09.750 --> 00:23:11.890
Space Fantasy

00:23:11.890 --> 00:23:16.220
I came all this way just to meet you
Anata ni ai ni kokomade kita no

00:23:16.220 --> 00:23:18.390
Space Fantasy

00:23:18.390 --> 00:23:22.300
I came all this way just to meet you
Anata ni ai ni kokomade kita no

00:23:22.300 --> 00:23:28.770
Even if you were from another planet,
Tatoeba anata ga betsu no hoshi no hito demo

00:23:28.770 --> 00:23:35.140
It wouldn't matter to me, if I'd fallen in love
Watashi wa kamawanai aishita nara

00:23:35.810 --> 00:23:39.040
Dirty, Stormy Destiny

00:23:39.110 --> 00:23:41.750
Dirty, Stormy Destiny

00:23:41.750 --> 00:23:48.210
Love is zero G...
Koi wa mujuuryoku...

00:24:02.940 --> 00:24:04.740
Hey, hey, hey! You there!

00:24:04.740 --> 00:24:07.510
You! Yeah, you! The one watching TV.

00:24:07.510 --> 00:24:08.710
Yes, you!

00:24:08.710 --> 00:24:11.680
We'll see you again next week.
Same time, same channel, okay?

00:24:11.680 --> 00:24:13.350
That's a promise.

00:24:13.350 --> 00:24:14.880
By the way, Yuri, what's next week's title?

00:24:14.880 --> 00:24:16.350
Yes, yes, next week's title is...

00:24:16.350 --> 00:24:20.720
"An Unjustified Lover's Grudge.
Let Me Love You Without Revenge!"

00:24:20.720 --> 00:24:21.560
Huh?

00:24:21.560 --> 00:24:22.990
Er, yeah, that's right!

00:24:22.990 --> 00:24:24.430
Next Episode
An Unjustified Lover's Grudge
Let Me Love You Without Revenge
We'll be waiting for you.

00:24:24.430 --> 00:24:26.460
Next Episode
An Unjustified Lover's Grudge
Let Me Love You Without Revenge
You'd better tune in
or you'll feel my wrath, got it?

00:24:26.460 --> 00:24:27.620
Next Episode
An Unjustified Lover's Grudge
Let Me Love You Without Revenge
